    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A protective aura radiates from you in a 30-foot Emanation for the duration. While in the aura, you and your allies have Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects, and when an affected creature succeeds on a save against a spell or magical effect that allows a save to take only half damage, it takes no damage instead.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-UewvexZXbYEHKneo\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect marks the creatures in the aura; apply their Advantage and the damage reduction by hand.</p></section>",
